        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maou's Crucible</strong> is a community-driven horde survivor roguelite featuring original characters  from various creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by <strong>Germain</strong>, a timeless scholar and alchemist, participants from countless worlds gather within a singularity, a nexus that connects all universes, where they would compete for the title of &quot;Demon Lord&quot;. However, this title is merely a bait to confront a far greater threat lurking beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Crucible, survive against hordes of enemies, and claim the title of <strong>Demon Lord</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of playable characters</strong> from multiple creators, each with unique abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ upgrades</strong> to create powerful and unpredictable builds each run</p></li></ul>",
